Drop an unpacked osu! skin folder here, e.g. danser/skins/MySkin/skin.ini.
The whole directory is baked into the image at /opt/danser/skins, and the
name is selected via [render] skin in config.toml (default: default).
Export from osu! (.osk files are zips — unzip them) or copy from the game's
Skins folder. See README "danser look" section.
